# Rust
target/
Cargo.lock.bak

# Local tool state. quality.json is the one exact shared/indexed policy file;
# never broaden this exception to a directory or wildcard.
.RaymanCodingSkill/*
!.RaymanCodingSkill/quality.json
.claude/

# Continuity's live ledger stays in this repository, but is not source input.
# Keep config.json and RECOVER.md visible; transfer the full store separately.
# Recovery and release boundaries: docs/CONTINUITY.md.
/.rayman-evidence/events.jsonl
/.rayman-evidence/objects/
/.rayman-evidence/write.lock

# Logs and temporary files
logs/
*.log
.tmp/
.cache/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local

